1. A Division Bench of this Court by an order dated 25-3-2002 directed the Registry to place the matter before the Chief Justice forreferring the issue relating to payment of compensation to the assignees of Government lands in the light of the Larger Bench decision reported in State of A.P. v. Bondapalli Sanyasi, (LB), and the Full Bench decision reported in
State A.P. v. P. Peda Chinnayya, (FB
), so that the controversy in this regard could be put to rest.
